<title>UK: Die Westhyp sets 100 mln mark reverse FRN.</title>
<headline>Die Westhyp sets 100 mln mark reverse FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DIE WESTHYP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *8.00	MATURITY    03.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REVERSE FRN   ISS PRICE  101.175   PAY DATE    03.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.00     LISTING     FFURT</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    32.5 BP   SELL CONC  2.175</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST THREE YEARS AND THEN 17 PCT LESS 2 TIMES</p>
<p>		 SIX MONTH DEM LIBOR THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 3921.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
